      "talk": [
        [
          "Iskar?",
          "What's left. A little light, in the mouth of a dead king. You came a long way to see a corpse."
        ],
        [
          "The blade.",
          "The Eclipse. I made it to cut the sun, and I lifted it, and I was too slow. It has been waiting a thousand years for a faster hand."
        ],
        [
          "Maraal.",
          "My herald. I watched her fall and I did not move. I have had a long time to be sorry."
        ],
        [
          "What should I do?",
          "Take the blade, and finish what I started. Or put it back in my hand and let me be buried at last. Either way, little half-god, I am so tired."
        ]
